#GtkActionGroup and set the accelerator for the action,
call gtk_action_group_add_action_with_accel().
See the [UI Definition section][XML-UI] for information on allowed action
names.</doc>
        <doc-deprecated xml:space="preserve">Use #GAction instead, associating it to a widget with
#GtkActionable or creating a #GtkMenu with gtk_menu_new_from_model()</doc-deprecated>
        <source-position filename="gtk/deprecated/gtkaction.h" line="98"/>
