      <method name="clamp_page" c:identifier="gtk_adjustment_clamp_page">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkadjustment.c"
             line="901">Updates the #GtkAdjustment:value property to ensure that the range
between @lower and @upper is in the current page (i.e. between
#GtkAdjustment:value and #GtkAdjustment:value + #GtkAdjustment:page-size).
If the range is larger than the page size, then only the start of it will
be in the current page.

A #GtkAdjustment::value-changed signal will be emitted if the value is changed.</doc>
