      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkappchooserdialog.c"
           line="25">#GtkAppChooserDialog shows a #GtkAppChooserWidget inside a #GtkDialog.

Note that #GtkAppChooserDialog does not have any interesting methods
of its own. Instead, you should get the embedded #GtkAppChooserWidget
using gtk_app_chooser_dialog_get_widget() and call its methods if
the generic #GtkAppChooser interface is not sufficient for your needs.

To set the heading that is shown above the #GtkAppChooserWidget,
use gtk_app_chooser_dialog_set_heading().</doc>
