      <method name="focus" c:identifier="gtk_cell_area_focus" version="3.0">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkcellarea.c"
             line="2894">This should be called by the @area’s owning layout widget
when focus is to be passed to @area, or moved within @area
