      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkcellrendererprogress.c"
           line="36">#GtkCellRendererProgress renders a numeric value as a progress par in a cell.
Additionally, it can display a text on top of the progress bar.

The #GtkCellRendererProgress cell renderer was added in GTK+ 2.6.</doc>
      <source-position filename="gtk/gtkcellrendererprogress.h" line="65"/>
      <implements name="Orientable"/>
      <constructor name="new"
