        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkcellview.c"
             line="1072">Creates a new #GtkCellView widget with a specific #GtkCellArea
to layout cells and a specific #GtkCellAreaContext.

Specifying the same context for a handfull of cells lets
the underlying area synchronize the geometry for those cells,
in this way alignments with cellviews for other rows are
possible.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk/gtkcellview.h" line="74"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
          <doc xml:space="preserve"
