      <method name="get_active_id"
              c:identifier="gtk_combo_box_get_active_id"
              glib:get-property="active-id"
              version="3.0">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkcombobox.c"
             line="5030">Returns the ID of the active row of @combo_box.  This value is taken
from the active row and the column specified by the #GtkComboBox:id-column
property of @combo_box (see gtk_combo_box_set_id_column()).

The returned value is an interned string which means that you can
compare the pointer by value to other interned strings and that you
must not free it.

If the #GtkComboBox:id-column property of @combo_box is not set, or if
no row is active, or if the active row has a %NULL ID value, then %NULL
is returned.</doc>
