                   version="2.12"
                   throws="1">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkprintsettings.c"
             line="1820">Reads the print settings from the group @group_name in @key_file.  Returns a
new #GtkPrintSettings object with the restored settings, or %NULL if an
error occurred. If the file could not be loaded then error is set to either
a #GFileError or #GKeyFileError.</doc>
