      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/deprecated/gtkrecentaction.c"
           line="34">A #GtkRecentAction represents a list of recently used files, which
can be shown by widgets such as #GtkRecentChooserDialog or
#GtkRecentChooserMenu.

To construct a submenu showing recently used files, use a #GtkRecentAction
as the action for a `&lt;menuitem&gt;`. To construct a menu toolbutton showing
the recently used files in the popup menu, use a #GtkRecentAction as the
action for a `&lt;toolitem&gt;` element.</doc>
