    <class name="Revealer"
           c:symbol-prefix="revealer"
           c:type="GtkRevealer"
           parent="Bin"
           glib:type-name="GtkRevealer"
           glib:get-type="gtk_revealer_get_type"
           glib:type-struct="RevealerClass">
      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkrevealer.c"
           line="34">The GtkRevealer widget is a container which animates
the transition of its child from invisible to visible.

The style of transition can be controlled with
gtk_revealer_set_transition_type().

These animations respect the #GtkSettings:gtk-enable-animations
setting.

# CSS nodes

GtkRevealer has a single CSS node with name revealer.

The GtkRevealer widget was added in GTK+ 3.10.</doc>
      <source-position filename="gtk/gtkrevealer.h" line="59"/>
      <implements name="Atk.ImplementorIface"/>
      <implements name="Buildable"/>
