      <method name="get_reveal_child"
              c:identifier="gtk_revealer_get_reveal_child"
              glib:get-property="reveal-child"
              version="3.10">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkrevealer.c"
             line="708">Returns whether the child is currently
revealed. See gtk_revealer_set_reveal_child().

This function returns %TRUE as soon as the transition
is to the revealed state is started. To learn whether
the child is fully revealed (ie the transition is completed),
use gtk_revealer_get_child_revealed().</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk/gtkrevealer.h" line="66"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
