      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkscalebutton.c"
           line="59">#GtkScaleButton provides a button which pops up a scale widget.
This kind of widget is commonly used for volume controls in multimedia
applications, and GTK+ provides a #GtkVolumeButton subclass that
is tailored for this use case.

# CSS nodes

GtkScaleButton has a single CSS node with name button. To differentiate
it from a plain #GtkButton, it gets the .scale style class.

The popup widget that contains the scale has a .scale-popup style class.</doc>
      <source-position filename="gtk/gtkscalebutton.h" line="77"/>
