      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkseparator.c"
           line="36">GtkSeparator is a horizontal or vertical separator widget, depending on the
value of the #GtkOrientable:orientation property, used to group the widgets
within a window. It displays a line with a shadow to make it appear sunken
into the interface.

# CSS nodes

GtkSeparator has a single CSS node with name separator. The node
gets one of the .horizontal or .vertical style classes.</doc>
