             filename="gtk/gtkspinbutton.c"
             line="2051">This is a convenience constructor that allows creation of a numeric
#GtkSpinButton without manually creating an adjustment. The value is
initially set to the minimum value and a page increment of 10 * @step
is the default. The precision of the spin button is equivalent to the
precision of @step.

Note that the way in which the precision is derived works best if @step
is a power of ten. If the resulting precision is not suitable for your
needs, use gtk_spin_button_set_digits() to correct it.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk/gtkspinbutton.h" line="155"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
