      <method name="copy" c:identifier="gtk_tree_iter_copy">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtktreemodel.c"
             line="1138">Creates a dynamically allocated tree iterator as a copy of @iter.

This function is not intended for use in applications,
because you can just copy the structs by value
(`GtkTreeIter new_iter = iter;`).
You must free this iter with gtk_tree_iter_free().</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk/gtktreemodel.h" line="292"/>
