    <function name="events_pending" c:identifier="gtk_events_pending">
      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk/gtkmain.c"
           line="1386">Checks if any events are pending.

This can be used to update the UI and invoke timeouts etc.
while doing some time intensive computation.

## Updating the UI during a long computation

|[&lt;!-- language="C" --&gt;
 // computation going on...

 while (gtk_events_pending ())
   gtk_main_iteration ();

 // ...computation continued
]|</doc>
      <source-position filename="gtk/gtkmain.h" line="149"/>
      <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk/gtkmain.c"
             line="1405">%TRUE if any events are pending, %FALSE otherwise</doc>
        <type name="gboolean" c:type="gboolean"/>
      </return-value>
    </function>
